You may be unaware of what happens when you win a lemon law case.

Customers who have suffered the consequences of owning a lemon vehicle and have spent a lot of time, money, and energy dealing with the effects of a lemon car. Consequently, they may be unaware of what to do after winning a lemon case. Therefore, it’s always best to get out of the situation as quickly and efficiently as possible.

The federal and state law offers basic guidelines that can help you determine what to expect once you have proved your case.

